                          "key": "paymentIntentId",
                          "value": "<string,null>",
                          "description": "(Required) The unique identifier of the payment intent.\n"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "Creates a refund. Refund allows you to return a payment that has previously been created as long as there have been no incremental payments or payment attempts, including unsuccessful payment attempts. You can refund the full amount or a partial amount."
